"author":"凌云翰","text":"戏担双鬼当双鱼，小妹停肩雪霁初。\n莫道丹青资一笑，人间物物是苞苴。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":20830,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"洗马图","author":"凌云翰","text":"层冰蹙裂度交河，天马谁能更作歌。\n却忆少陵诗思好，乱蝉鸣处晚凉多。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":20831,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"墨梅","author":"凌云翰","text":"两蕊三花便可人，分明笔底有阳春。\n平生一点和羹意，不到中书未是真。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":20832,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"画红梅","author":"凌云翰","text":"漫传丹桂冠西风，文彩重教下笔同。\n谁信岁寒冰雪后，花中还有状元红。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":20833,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"画 其一","author":"凌云翰","text":"溪山花柳斗清妍，几度春来放酒船。\n画里生绡无一尺，为谁展尽白鸥天。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":20834,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"画 其二","author":"凌云翰","text":"扁舟与客共游遨，风月无边入彩毫。\n长为江山增感慨，后前两赋类庄骚。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":20835,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"画 其三","author":"凌云翰","text":"柳阴楼阁又清和，拂晓薰风入扇罗。\n女伴相呼知有约，水边亭子看新荷。","collection":"元","notice":"","provena